# SHA256 of the reference inputs, as used for every number in the manuscript.
# Verify after fetching:  shasum -a 256 -c data/checksums.sha256
# Entries are added here as each file is fetched; run data/make_checksums.sh to
# regenerate for files you have downloaded yourself.
#
# Nothing here is committed. Every entry is absent from a fresh clone, so `shasum -c`
# reports it missing until data/fetch.sh has fetched it. Use --ignore-missing to check
# only what you have.
#
